          "comment": "# Comfy Ovis-Image Text to Image\n\nOvis-Image is a 7B text-to-image model specifically optimized for high-quality text rendering in generated images. Designed to operate efficiently under computational constraints, it excels at accurately generating images containing text content. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_ovis_text_to_image.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
